<view class="pg10-page source-page" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
  <view class="source-status" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px"></view>
  <view class="pg10-header source-header" style="padding-right: {{headerPaddingRight}}; top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
    <button class="pg10-back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回"><image src="./assets/arrow_back_ios_new.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><view class="pg10-header-title">开源许可与致谢</view>
    <view class="pg10-header-actions"><button class="pg10-header-share" open-type="share" aria-label="分享开源许可与致谢"><image src="./assets/ios_share.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><button class="pg10-header-more" bindtap="toggleMore" aria-label="更多页面入口" aria-expanded="{{moreOpen}}"><image src="./assets/more_horiz.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><button class="pg10-header-avatar" bindtap="goProfile" aria-label="返回我的页面"><image src="./assets/person.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{moreOpen}}" class="pg10-header-menu" style="right: {{headerPaddingRight}}"><button bindtap="goAbout">关于 Project IRL　›</button><button bindtap="goProfile">我的页面　›</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="source-content">
    <view class="source-intro pg10-card"><view class="intro-head"><view class="source-icon"><image src="./assets/code.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="intro-heading"><view class="intro-title">开源许可与致谢</view><text decode="{{true}}">OPEN SOURCE SOFTWARE &amp; SPECIAL THANKS</text></view></view><view class="intro-copy">Project IRL 的构建离不开开源社区。以下列出当前工程直接使用的部分依赖及图标资源；完整许可义务以发布时依赖清单及原许可文件为准。</view></view>
    <view class="source-section"><view><image src="./assets/terminal.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>引入的开源组件</text></view><text class="source-count">5 项依赖 · 1 项图标资源</text></view>
    <view class="dependency-list">
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">PostgreSQL 客户端 pg</view><view class="dependency-maker">Brian Carlson</view></view><text class="license-badge">MIT</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">支持服务端数据库连接与活动记录读取。</view><view class="dependency-copyright">Copyright (c) 2010 - 2021 Brian Carlson</view></view>
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">PGlite</view><view class="dependency-maker">ElectricSQL</view></view><text class="license-badge apache">Apache-2.0</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">用于本地开发和测试环境中的数据库。</view></view>
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">TypeScript</view><view class="dependency-maker">Microsoft</view></view><text class="license-badge apache">Apache-2.0</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">为工程提供类型检查与构建支持。</view></view>
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">tsx</view><view class="dependency-maker">开发与测试工具</view></view><text class="license-badge">MIT</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">运行 TypeScript 开发脚本和测试。</view></view>
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">qrcode-generator</view><view class="dependency-maker">二维码生成依赖</view></view><text class="license-badge">MIT</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">为当前工程中的二维码功能提供生成能力。</view></view>
      <view class="dependency-card pg10-card"><view class="dependency-head"><view><view class="dependency-title">Material Symbols</view><view class="dependency-maker">Google</view></view><text class="license-badge apache">Apache-2.0</text></view><view class="dependency-copy">使用官方 Outlined 图标的本地 SVG 资源；许可正文已随工程保留。</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="thanks-card pg10-card"><view class="thanks-head"><view class="thanks-icon"><image src="./assets/favorite.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view><view class="thanks-title">项目与特别致谢</view><text>Special Acknowledgments</text></view></view>
      <view class="thanks-list"><view class="thanks-row"><view class="thanks-row-title"><image src="./assets/celebration.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>测试与反馈</text></view><view>感谢参与本地受控活动测试与反馈的协作者。</view></view><view class="thanks-row"><view class="thanks-row-title"><image src="./assets/touch_app.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>设计参考</text></view><view>设计参考来自 Project IRL 当前提供的 Stitch 开发包。</view></view><view class="thanks-row"><view class="thanks-row-title"><image src="./assets/diversity_3.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>项目与贡献记录</text></view><view>可在仓库核对代码、依赖和最新状态；正式贡献者名单待发布。</view></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="source-section license-section"><view><image src="./assets/gavel.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>许可说明</text></view></view><view class="license-note">上列是依赖与图标资源的许可标识摘要，不构成完整许可正文。各组件的版权与许可条款，以仓库中实际安装包及其原许可文件为准。</view>
    <view class="repository-card pg10-card"><view class="repository-title">项目仓库</view><text>github.com/tony132321/miniprogram</text><button bindtap="copyRepository"><text>复制仓库地址</text><image src="./assets/open_in_new.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></button><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="copy-message">{{message}}</view></view>
    <view class="source-foot">Built with care for real-world connections.</view>
  </view>
</view>
